. /*===========================================================================
> ===
>  design1_decay_plots_5km_detrended.do
> 
>  EXPLORATORY EXTREME: detrended decay figures for the 5km spec (control
>  4000-5000m). Same method as the 3.5km version: per-bin linear pre-drift
>  fitted through the base period and projected out of all coefficients;
>  pooled points shifted by slope x mean(h+1) (post 2.5, pre -1.5).
> 
>  CAVEATS: 4-5km controls are in different housing markets; the drift removed
>  here is the largest in the ladder, extrapolated 4+ years, and treated as
>  known (CIs shifted, not widened). This is a how-far-does-the-linear-story
>  stretch exercise -- NOT a headline spec.
> 
>  Figures: figD8_es_inner_5km_dt  (0-250 / 250-500 / 500-1000)
>           figD9_es_mid_5km_dt    (1000-1750 / 1750-2500)
>           figD10_es_outer_5km_dt (2500-3500 / 3500-4000)
>           figD11_decay_5km_dt    (raw vs detrended pooled post + detrended pr
> e)
> =============================================================================
> =*/
. 
